      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4246215820312,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "evaluated the accuracy of AlereLAM for TB diagnosis in participants with signs and symptoms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.411376953125,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "suggestive of TB; these studies involved 3449 participants, of whom 1277 (37%) had TB. Seven",
