      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4201049804688,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "studies evaluated the accuracy of AlereLAM for diagnosis of unselected participants who may or",
