      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        427.128662109375,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "“symptomatic participants” and TB diagnosis among “unselected participants”.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4277954101562,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "Unlike traditional diagnostic methods, evidence demonstrates improved sensitivity in people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.42333984375,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "with HIV with low CD4 cell counts. In addition, the pooled risk ratio from two randomized trials on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        524.397216796875,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the impact of AlereLAM in reducing mortality associated with advanced HIV disease was 0.85 (0.76–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4386596679688,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "0.94); and the absolute effect was 35 fewer deaths per 1000 (from 14 fewer to 55 fewer). Economic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4223022460938,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "evidence for the implementation and scale-up of LF-LAM is limited. The studies that have been done",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
